{"seq":3,"slug":"api-gateway","title":"API 网关与 BFF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/api-gateway","wordCount":1137,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"api-网关与-bff\">API 网关与 BFF</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>API 网关是微服务架构的统一入口，负责请求路由、协议转换、认证鉴权、限流熔断等横切关注点。BFF（Backend For Frontend）模式进一步为不同前端（Web、Mobile、第三方）提供定制化的 API 层，避免通用 API 的臃肿和低效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>API 网关的定位是&quot;把横切关注点从业务服务里收拢出来&quot;，四个概念划清了它的边界：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>网关 vs 业务逻辑</strong>：网关只做路由、协议转换、认证、限流、聚合、缓存、日志这类横切功能，业务逻辑不应下沉到网关。</li>\n<li><strong>单一网关 vs BFF</strong>：单一网关简单集中但可能成为瓶颈；BFF 按前端定制、职责清晰，代价是维护多个入口。</li>\n<li><strong>限流算法</strong>：固定窗口、滑动窗口、令牌桶、漏桶，区别在能否平滑突发——令牌桶允许突发，漏桶完全平滑。</li>\n<li><strong>熔断器</strong>：Closed/Open/HalfOpen 三态，失败率超阈值即快速失败，超时后放少量请求试探，避免故障级联。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主线：<strong>网关的价值来自&quot;统一入口&quot;——所有横切关注点在一处实现，服务只关心业务；而它自身的风险也来自&quot;统一入口&quot;——必须无状态多实例部署，否则它就成了新的单点。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"api-网关的角色\">API 网关的角色</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  W[Web App] --&gt; GW[API Gateway]&#10;  M[Mobile App] --&gt; GW&#10;  T[第三方] --&gt; GW&#10;  GW --&gt; S1[用户服务]&#10;  GW --&gt; S2[订单服务]&#10;  GW --&gt; S3[商品服务]&#10;  GW --&gt; S4[支付服务]\">graph TD\n  W[Web App] --&gt; GW[API Gateway]\n  M[Mobile App] --&gt; GW\n  T[第三方] --&gt; GW\n  GW --&gt; S1[用户服务]\n  GW --&gt; S2[订单服务]\n  GW --&gt; S3[商品服务]\n  GW --&gt; S4[支付服务]</pre><h3 id=\"核心功能\">核心功能</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求路由</td>\n<td>根据路径/头部转发到后端服务</td>\n<td>/api/orders → 订单服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议转换</td>\n<td>HTTP → gRPC，REST → GraphQL</td>\n<td>外部 REST 内部 gRPC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证鉴权</td>\n<td>JWT 验证、OAuth2、API Key</td>\n<td>统一认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流熔断</td>\n<td>保护后端服务不被过载</td>\n<td>令牌桶限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求聚合</td>\n<td>合并多个服务的响应</td>\n<td>一次请求获取用户+订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>缓存常用响应减少后端压力</td>\n<td>商品列表缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志监控</td>\n<td>统一的访问日志和指标采集</td>\n<td>请求延迟 P99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"网关架构模式\">网关架构模式</h2><h3 id=\"单一网关\">单一网关</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[所有客户端] --&gt; GW[单一 API Gateway]&#10;  GW --&gt; S1[服务 A]&#10;  GW --&gt; S2[服务 B]&#10;  GW --&gt; S3[服务 C]\">graph TD\n  C[所有客户端] --&gt; GW[单一 API Gateway]\n  GW --&gt; S1[服务 A]\n  GW --&gt; S2[服务 B]\n  GW --&gt; S3[服务 C]</pre><h3 id=\"bff-模式\">BFF 模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  W[Web] --&gt; BFF_W[Web BFF]&#10;  M[Mobile] --&gt; BFF_M[Mobile BFF]&#10;  T[第三方] --&gt; BFF_T[Open API]&#10;  BFF_W --&gt; S1[服务 A]&#10;  BFF_W --&gt; S2[服务 B]&#10;  BFF_M --&gt; S1&#10;  BFF_M --&gt; S3[服务 C]&#10;  BFF_T --&gt; S2\">graph TD\n  W[Web] --&gt; BFF_W[Web BFF]\n  M[Mobile] --&gt; BFF_M[Mobile BFF]\n  T[第三方] --&gt; BFF_T[Open API]\n  BFF_W --&gt; S1[服务 A]\n  BFF_W --&gt; S2[服务 B]\n  BFF_M --&gt; S1\n  BFF_M --&gt; S3[服务 C]\n  BFF_T --&gt; S2</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一网关</td>\n<td>简单、集中管理</td>\n<td>可能成为瓶颈</td>\n<td>小型系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFF</td>\n<td>定制化、职责清晰</td>\n<td>维护多个 BFF</td>\n<td>多端差异化大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多层网关</td>\n<td>边缘 + 内部分层</td>\n<td>架构复杂</td>\n<td>大型系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"限流算法\">限流算法</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>突发处理</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定窗口</td>\n<td>时间窗口内计数</td>\n<td>窗口边界突发</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>滑动时间窗口计数</td>\n<td>较平滑</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>令牌桶</td>\n<td>固定速率放入令牌</td>\n<td>允许突发</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏桶</td>\n<td>固定速率流出请求</td>\n<td>完全平滑</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import time&#10;&#10;class TokenBucket:&#10;    def __init__(self, rate, capacity):&#10;        self.rate = rate&#10;        self.capacity = capacity&#10;        self.tokens = capacity&#10;        self.last_refill = time.time()&#10;&#10;    def allow(self):&#10;        now = time.time()&#10;        elapsed = now - self.last_refill&#10;        self.tokens = min(self.capacity, self.tokens + elapsed * self.rate)&#10;        self.last_refill = now&#10;        if self.tokens &gt;= 1:&#10;            self.tokens -= 1&#10;            return True&#10;        return False\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenBucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, rate, capacity):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.capacity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capacity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capacity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_refill </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.time()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.time()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_refill</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.capacity, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_refill </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"熔断器模式\">熔断器模式</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Closed&#10;  Closed --&gt; Open: 失败率超过阈值&#10;  Open --&gt; HalfOpen: 超时后试探&#10;  HalfOpen --&gt; Closed: 试探成功&#10;  HalfOpen --&gt; Open: 试探失败\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Closed\n  Closed --&gt; Open: 失败率超过阈值\n  Open --&gt; HalfOpen: 超时后试探\n  HalfOpen --&gt; Closed: 试探成功\n  HalfOpen --&gt; Open: 试探失败</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>转换条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Closed</td>\n<td>正常转发请求</td>\n<td>失败率 &gt; 阈值 → Open</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Open</td>\n<td>快速拒绝所有请求</td>\n<td>超时 → HalfOpen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HalfOpen</td>\n<td>放行少量请求试探</td>\n<td>成功 → Closed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"主流-api-网关对比\">主流 API 网关对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网关</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Nginx</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>高性能、成熟</td>\n<td>反向代理/入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kong</td>\n<td>Lua/Nginx</td>\n<td>插件丰富、API 管理</td>\n<td>API 生命周期管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>APISIX</td>\n<td>Lua/Nginx</td>\n<td>高性能、动态路由</td>\n<td>云原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Envoy</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td>L4/L7 代理、可观测性</td>\n<td>Service Mesh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spring Cloud Gateway</td>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>Spring 生态集成</td>\n<td>Java 微服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traefik</td>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>自动服务发现、Let&#39;s Encrypt</td>\n<td>Kubernetes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"请求聚合示例\">请求聚合示例</h2><p>网关将多个后端调用合并为一个前端响应：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;import aiohttp&#10;&#10;async def aggregate_user_dashboard(user_id):&#10;    async with aiohttp.ClientSession() as session:&#10;        user_task = session.get(f&quot;http://user-svc/users/{user_id}&quot;)&#10;        orders_task = session.get(f&quot;http://order-svc/users/{user_id}/orders&quot;)&#10;        notifications_task = session.get(f&quot;http://notification-svc/users/{user_id}/unread&quot;)&#10;&#10;        user, orders, notifications = await asyncio.gather(&#10;            user_task, orders_task, notifications_task&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        return {&#10;            &quot;user&quot;: await user.json(),&#10;            &quot;recent_orders&quot;: await orders.json(),&#10;            &quot;unread_count&quot;: await notifications.json(),&#10;        }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aiohttp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aggregate_user_dashboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aiohttp.ClientSession() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user_task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session.get(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://user-svc/users/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        orders_task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session.get(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://order-svc/users/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        notifications_task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session.get(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://notification-svc/users/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/unread\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user, orders, notifications </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.gather(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            user_task, orders_task, notifications_task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.json(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"recent_orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders.json(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"unread_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notifications.json(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"安全实践\">安全实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层面</th>\n<th>措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>认证</td>\n<td>JWT/OAuth2 统一认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权</td>\n<td>RBAC/ABAC 细粒度权限控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输</td>\n<td>TLS 加密、mTLS（服务间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防护</td>\n<td>WAF、SQL 注入/XSS 防御</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计</td>\n<td>访问日志、操作审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>API 网关只做横切关注点（路由、认证、限流），不要放业务逻辑</li>\n<li>多端差异大时使用 BFF 模式，由前端团队维护各自的 BFF</li>\n<li>限流策略分层设置——网关全局限流 + 各服务自身限流</li>\n<li>熔断超时时间根据下游服务 P99 延迟设置</li>\n<li>使用 OpenAPI/Swagger 规范管理 API 文档</li>\n<li>网关自身必须高可用——多实例部署 + 无状态设计</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>API 网关把路由、协议转换、认证、限流熔断、请求聚合等横切关注点收拢到统一入口，让业务服务只需专注业务——但这也意味着网关自身不能成为单点，必须无状态多实例部署。多端差异大时用 BFF 按前端定制，限流分层设置（网关全局 + 服务自身），熔断超时按下游 P99 延迟设定。所有设计的共同底线是：横切逻辑留在网关，业务逻辑不进网关。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"API 网关与 BFF","id":"api-网关与-bff"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"API 网关的角色","id":"api-网关的角色"},{"level":3,"text":"核心功能","id":"核心功能"},{"level":2,"text":"网关架构模式","id":"网关架构模式"},{"level":3,"text":"单一网关","id":"单一网关"},{"level":3,"text":"BFF 模式","id":"bff-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"限流算法","id":"限流算法"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断器模式","id":"熔断器模式"},{"level":2,"text":"主流 API 网关对比","id":"主流-api-网关对比"},{"level":2,"text":"请求聚合示例","id":"请求聚合示例"},{"level":2,"text":"安全实践","id":"安全实践"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务注册与发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/service-discovery"},"next":{"title":"分布式链路追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/distributed-tracing"}}